WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.610
Markets grows a third thing. DvP: a trade where both legs move, or neither does.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:09.121
Every trade in the list opens at the stage it is actually at.

00:00:09.471 --> 00:00:13.439
Fund your leg and the escrow holds it — yours until the other side is in.

00:00:13.789 --> 00:00:20.433
Every figure comes from one place now. Three pages used to quote three different totals for the same four wallets.

00:00:20.783 --> 00:00:25.986
Command K searches the whole prototype. It used to be a shortcut nothing listened for.

00:00:26.336 --> 00:00:28.557
And every provider wears its own logo.
